      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Olist BI — Supabase → Google Sheets Bridge\nRuns 3 parallel branches on a schedule. Each branch: query\nSupabase Postgres → clear the matching Google Sheet tab →\nappend fresh rows.\n\nBuilt as a workaround: Looker Studio's native PostgreSQL\nconnector wouldn't connect to Supabase (persistent unresolved\nsystem error across pooler + direct connection configs).\nLooker Studio reads from these Sheets instead.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 512,
        "color": 6
      },
